  "description": "Merged the github-actions bumps after checking CI genuinely exercised the artifact upload and download round-trip across their major versions. Held the docker bump, which moved the shipped base image to PHP 8.5: ten checks were green but the image job only proves the container boots, and the matrix ran 8.4 alone, so no application code was executed on 8.5 anywhere -- the same gap that let composer.json advertise 8.3 support its own lock file made impossible. Opened a PR adding the 8.5 leg so that bump could be judged on evidence, and opened the container smoke test.",
